Astro Cleanfit
==============

The initial visual design and the demo assets in public/images are adapted
from the "lite" theme in the next-typecho project.

Included adapted assets:
- public/images/avatar.png
- public/images/lite-brand-mountains.webp
- public/images/lite-card-pure.jpg

Before publicly redistributing this repository, the maintainer must confirm
